<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends down on origins, cocoa ends soft.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends down on origins, cocoa ends soft.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Ends weak on origin sales, July ends down $28 on $1,600 support.</p>
<p>COCOA - Ends down amid light volume, nearby switches dominate.</p>
<p>July down 10 at 1,044.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Slides but off session low. Aug down 1.1 at 313.80.</p>
</text>
